"t":"p","html":"NVIDIA Jetson Thor represents a major advancement in edge AI computing, providing the processing power required for modern robotics and physical AI applications. Designed around the NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, it enables developers and organizations to deploy advanced AI models directly on autonomous systems without compromising performance.<br><br>Whether developing humanoid robots, autonomous mobile robots, AI-powered inspection systems, industrial automation, or intelligent vision applications, Jetson Thor provides a scalable platform that combines high-performance computing with efficient power consumption for demanding edge environments."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["Accelerate AI application development","Deploy large AI models at the edge","Enable real-time computer vision","Support generative AI workloads","Reduce cloud dependency compartments","High-performance edge computing","Comprehensive NVIDIA software ecosystem","Scalable for commercial and industrial deployment"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor"},{"t":"p","html":"NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor is the flagship module within the Jetson Thor family, delivering up to <strong>2070 FP4 TFLOPS</strong> of AI performance, <strong>128 GB LPDDR5X memory</strong>, and a <strong>Blackwell GPU architecture</strong> in a compact embedded platform. Designed for physical AI, robotics, and next-generation autonomous systems, it offers up to <strong>7.5× the AI performance</strong> and <strong>3.5× the energy efficiency</strong> of the previous AGX Orin generation."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><g id=\"Layer_5\" data-name=\"Layer 5\"><path d=\"M30,42h4a1,1,0,0,0,1-1V38a1,1,0,0,0-1-1H30a1,1,0,0,0-1,1v3A1,1,0,0,0,30,